commit 4680045b6149cf1d71d529c9be05d29a75a47009
Author: Andrew Deason <adeason@sinenomine.net>
Date:   Tue Sep 15 14:47:50 2026 -0500

    WINNT: Remove strcpy() in ktc_ForgetTokensByCell()
    
    Since OpenAFS 1.0, ktc_ForgetTokensByCell() (then ktc_ForgetToken()) has
    strcpy()d the cell from the provided arguments into the stack-local
    "tbuffer" before passing the cell to the VIOCDELTOK pioctl.
    
    There's no reason to use an intermediate stack buffer; just pass the
    given string pointer directly to the pioctl, so we don't risk
    overrunning the "tbuffer" with an unsafe strcpy() call.
    
