    viced: do not overwrite possible failure
    
    The function ‘hpr_Initialize’ overwrites the code
    returned by ‘ubik_ClientInit’. As a result, ‘hpr_Initialize’
    will not report any failure triggered by ‘ubik_ClientInit’.
    
